OL,3,GNEWSANew prisoner early release scheme
OL,4,Abegins as probation officer warns 'I've
OL,5,Ano idea how we'll cope'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne probation officer, who will be
OL,8,Fresponsible for monitoring some of the
OL,9,Fearly releases, says managing the
OL,10,Finflux of offenders is "just too much"
OL,12,FA prison govenor says the scheme is
OL,13,F"much needed relief" from the pressure
OL,14,Fof overcrowded prisons but cautions it
OL,15,Fwon't "solve the overarching problem"
OL,17,FPrisoners being released early today
OL,18,Fwill include those convicted of fraud,
OL,19,Fdomestic abuse, and coercive control
